The authoritative snapshot confirms my plan direction and refines two details I'll fold in: the queue is a **static 2-node fleet** (MinCount=MaxCount=2, all-or-nothing), so capacity must cover exactly 2 nodes, and the Sep 23 change is explicitly ruled out as a mitigation target. My validated plan (0 violations) already matches this. Here is the finalized proposal.

